Smoother time sync (melee-unlocked's experimental MELEE_SYNC_SMOOTH=1, hle/slippi_online.cpp): this side's speed
correction starts at 2 ms ahead instead of 8, up to 1%. Unset, nothing changes. Applied by ../net_sources.sh after the net patches.
